# New Look for 2018

It is finally here! After many long days of computer work, (three months worth in fact), decisions and the rest... we can finally say that Rhythm Culture has had a huge makeover, a whole new look, new website and new logo. Please take a moment to jump over and have a look at our new [website.](/) Booking classes, workshops and finding out in general about what we do should be a whole lot easier. Huge thank you to [Karla Pizzica](https://www.karlapizzica.com/) for all of her hard work! We are super stoked and look forward to kicking off the New Year feeling fresh and looking good!! We hope you enjoy it!
